Cognate with {{och-l|佐|to assist}} (< be on one's left side); mirror of the semantic relationship between {{och-l|右|id=1|right}} and {{och-l|佑|to assist}} ({{zh-ref|Schuessler, 2007}}).

Unrelated to {{ncog|tbq-pro|*b(w)aj||left (hand)}} (STEDT).

; “(politics) left-wing”
