#* {{zh-x|若 已 食 則 退，若 未 食 則 佐 長者 視 具。| If they '''have''' eaten '''already''', they should retire; if they have not eaten, they will [remain to] assist their elder [brothers and sisters] and see what has been prepared.|ref=Liji}}
